Manage the connection-backed tools attached to a toolbox.

Tools are project connections. Supported categories: RemoteTool (MCP),
CognitiveSearch (Azure AI Search), RemoteA2A, and GroundingWithCustomSearch.
Each mutation creates a new immutable version branched from the toolbox's
latest version, so sequential operations accumulate. Use --from-version to
branch from a specific version instead. The toolbox's default version is
unchanged; use 'azd ai toolbox publish <toolbox> <version>' to promote a
version.

Usage
  azd ai toolbox connection [command]

Available Commands
  add    : Attach one or more connections to a toolbox.
  list   : List the connection-backed tools attached to a toolbox.
  remove : Detach one or more connections from a toolbox.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for connection
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (default "default")
      --project-endpoint string : Foundry project endpoint URL for remote operations only (not local add or extension version).

Examples
  Inspect a toolbox's connections
    azd ai toolbox connection list research

  Attach an existing project connection in a new version
    azd ai toolbox connection add research my-mcp

Use azd ai toolbox connection [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
